{{DisambigPage|Bosses}}
'''Bosses''' may refer to:
*[[Enemy Units#Bosses|Bosses]], a special status that any [[Enemy Units|Enemy]] can be assigned, with them spawning on a timer or with base HP values, and with other unique properties.
*[[Advent Bosses]], the main enemies in [[Advent Stages]], characterized by high stats, powerful [[Abilities]], and typically being designed to require unique strategies to defeat.
*[[Mythic Bosses]], the Enemy counterparts of the [[Mythic Cat|Mythic Cats]], with similar characteristics as the Advent Bosses, but generally being more reliant on support and allowing for more conventional strategies.